1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:04,220
(Howard:)You saw what's under this robe,
and you still married me.

2
00:00:04,223 --> 00:00:06,423
(Bernadette:)If you're really worried,
we'll take him to the vet

3
00:00:06,426 --> 00:00:07,626
(Bernadette:)and have him tested.
Good.

4
00:00:07,627 --> 00:00:09,997
(Howard:)Thank you. Oh, okay,
there is a test!

5
00:00:09,996 --> 00:00:11,996
(Howard:)All they have to do is...

6
00:00:11,998 --> 00:00:14,028
(Howard:)cut off his head
and check his brain.

7
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:16,163
(Bernadette:)Oh, cut off his head?

8
00:00:16,169 --> 00:00:19,939
(Bernadette:)That's where
his little nose is.

9
00:00:19,939 --> 00:00:23,239
(Howard:)He's not showing
any symptoms.

10
00:00:23,242 --> 00:00:27,012
(Howard:)I guess I'll just go to the
emergency room to be safe.

11
00:00:27,013 --> 00:00:29,283
(Bernadette:)Howie, this is just
your hypochondria.

12
00:00:29,282 --> 00:00:31,282
(Howard:)No, when I sat
on the mute button

13
00:00:31,284 --> 00:00:33,854
(Howard:)and thought I'd gone deaf,
that was my hypochondria.

14
00:00:42,428 --> 00:00:45,598
(Bernadette:)We'll find another time
to tell him I'm pregnant.

15
00:00:52,138 --> 00:00:54,268
KOOTHRAPPALI:
I mean, this is the first time

16
00:00:54,273 --> 00:00:56,203
(Raj(voice):)I've ever broken up
with someone.

17
00:00:56,209 --> 00:00:59,139
(Raj(voice):)I just... I didn't realize
it was gonna hurt this much.

